{
  "note": "这套 fixtures 是 dashboard producer / Android / iOS decoder 三方对齐的契约样本。dashboard 发布前应把本文件当作 consumer 兼容性检查。iOS 与 dashboard 采用同一 fixtures 是 follow-up，本次只在 Android 落地。数值都是人工构造，不是真实用量快照。provider/label 使用中性名。producer 侧 used_percentage/remaining_percentage 是必需非 null float；observed_at/measurement_source 以及 next_reset_time_ms/usage/remaining 可选。null、缺失、类型漂移、非有限浮点是 consumer 失败边界，不是 producer 应发出的形状。percentage_resolution/pool_id/account_fingerprint 是 producer 可能新增的字段，consumer 必须忽略。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "half_integer_neighbors",
      "coverage": "partial",
      "coveredBy": "AIUsageQuotaFormatTest already locks 2.5/97.5 complementary display; 2.499999 and 2.500001 are new",
      "note": "Android uses kotlin.math.roundToInt: nearest integer, half ties toward +inf (e.g. 2.5 -> 3, 97.5 -> 98). Displayed used is 100 minus clamped remaining, so the pair always sums to 100 even when the independently rounded raw fields do not. Negative half values are out of the producer contract and not asserted here.",
      "body": "{\"generated_at\":\"2020-01-01T00:00:00\",\"quotas\":[{\"provider\":\"test-a\",\"label\":\"near\",\"used_percentage\":2.499999,\"remaining_percentage\":97.500001},{\"provider\":\"test-a\",\"label\":\"tie\",\"used_percentage\":2.5,\"remaining_percentage\":97.5},{\"provider\":\"test-a\",\"label\":\"over\",\"used_percentage\":2.500001,\"remaining_percentage\":97.499999}]}",
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "success",
        "items": [
          {
            "provider": "test-a",
            "label": "near",
            "used": 2,
            "remaining": 98,
            "clampedUsed": 2,
            "clampedRemaining": 98
          },
          {
            "provider": "test-a",
            "label": "tie",
            "used": 3,
            "remaining": 98,
            "clampedUsed": 2,
            "clampedRemaining": 98
          },
          {
            "provider": "test-a",
            "label": "over",
            "used": 3,
            "remaining": 97,
            "clampedUsed": 3,
            "clampedRemaining": 97
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
